      "title": "Sun Pharma Advanced Research Company Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 1.4999645 billion in funding from Shanghvi Finance Pvt Ltd",
      "body": "Sun Pharma Advanced Research Company Limited announced a private placement of 38,510,000 Pre-Funded Convertible Warrants at a price per share of INR 38.95 for gross proceeds of INR 1,499,964,500 on January 14, 2026 on preferential basis. Each warrant is convertible into one fully paid-up equity share of the Company having a face value of INR 1 each, within a period of 18 (eighteen) months from the date of allotment of the Warrants, in accordance with applicable law. The transaction involves participation from returning investor Shanghvi Finance Private Limited to purchase 38,510,000 Warrants. The pre-issue equity holding of the investor is 42.28% and post-issue equity holding after exercise of the Warrants will be 48.40% with 175,721,787 equity shares of the company.",
